# FitPower currently needs no environment variables: all data stays in the
# browser (localStorage / IndexedDB) and there is no backend yet.
#
# When you add one, copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill it in.
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser bundle, so never
# put a secret behind that prefix; secrets belong on a server, not in the client.
#
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
